# Presence of this file arms the self-test battery.
#
# Options:
#   shutdown=true   power the machine off when the run finishes (CI)
#   only=20-        run only checks whose name starts with this
#   screen=true     allow checks that DRAW on the boot console
#
# `screen` is OFF by default and that is deliberate. The boot console is
# a scrolling log and the battery logs while it runs, so a drawing check
# cannot stay invisible -- a row saved at one moment holds different
# content two seconds later, and restoring it puts stale text back.
# Turn it on when you want the display answers and accept a messy
# console for that round.
